	;SIEGE UNITS (battering-ram-line, mangonel-line, scorpion-line, trebuchet-set, and unique-unit-line (organ-gun-line, hussite-wagon-line etc) - COMPLETE
	;BOAT UNITS (galley-line, fire-ship-line, caravel-line, turtle-ship-line, longboat-line etc) - NOT COMPLETE
	;FORWARD FORTIFICATION BUILDINGS (watch-tower-line, donjon, krepost, bombard-tower, castles) - NOT COMPLETE

	;don't forget to use (goal MILITARY-TRAINING yes)
